## Key Design Decisions

### SCHEMA_MAP Adaptive Pattern
The test uses a `SCHEMA_MAP` object to bridge between spec field names and actual system field names:

| Spec (Tài liệu) | System (Thực tế) | Logic |
|---|---|---|
| `user_id` | `id` | UUID identifier |
| `access_token` | `accessToken` | JWT token |
| `booking_id` | `_id` | MongoDB ObjectId |
| `status: REQUESTED` | `status: SEARCHING` | "Đang tìm xe" |
| `driver status: ONLINE` | `is_available: true` | Boolean availability |
| `price` | `totalFare` | Final computed fare |
| `surge` | `surgeMultiplier` | ≥ 1.0 multiplier |
| `eta` | `predictedTripDurationMinutes` | Minutes |

### TC07 ETA Fallback Strategy
AI ETA service may be unavailable → test uses 3-tier fallback:
1. Ride-service `/api/rides/eta` (has built-in fallback)
2. Direct AI ETA service `localhost:4002`
3. Manual Haversine distance calculation

